# ========================================================
# Khushi Tiwari Portfolio - Environment Configuration
# ========================================================
# For production email delivery via EmailJS (https://www.emailjs.com/):
# Sign up, create an Email Service and Email Template, then paste your keys below:
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_emailjs_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_emailjs_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_emailjs_public_key_here

# Alternatively, for Formspree (https://formspree.io/):
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your_form_id_here

# When these keys are omitted or set to placeholder values,
# the portfolio runs safely in interactive "Demo / Preview Mode"
# with full validation and an explicit informational banner.
